title: "Semantic Engineering: An AI-led SDLC Methodology"
abstract: >-
  Semantic Engineering is a methodology for AI-led software delivery developed
  at Accion Labs. It models an enterprise application as a four-layer knowledge
  graph (functional, design, architecture, and code) that AI agents query for
  precise, governed context, addressing the "Manual Translation Tax" of feeding
  tacit enterprise knowledge to coding agents.
